      "message": "Kind of.  Everything can be considered a sub-feature in some way.\n\nIs it expected that nearly everyone who enables TRUSTY will need all these other options enabled too?  If so, default y could be okay.  But if there are substantial use cases for not having these other options enabled, then they shouldn\u0027t be enabled by default.\n\nAlso, are any of these options actually required for everyone?  Anything that is required shouldn\u0027t be an option.",
